                        "review": "Fun Game! Snapped this up in a sale for a couple of quid and it proved good value for money.\r\n\r\n+ Looks cute, charming characters\r\n+ Easy to Understand\r\n+ Runs on Low spec machines\r\n+ Challenging, without being too frustrating\r\n+ Level creator\r\n\r\n- Woolly collision detection\r\n- Faux-isometric presentation of an effectively 2D game leads to some issues placing blocks\r\n- Arguably a little short? (Although, again, there's a level creator)\r\n- Probably not difficult enough for hardcore puzzle gamers (Speculation; I am not one of them)",
